{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"53a26cf39698a6e61ee7489176c5b3f3f41c4b6fa0f0ceab7f554dcfa1fb286e","ja":"前半のトークパートが終わり、\n続けて後半のパートが始まることになっていて……","zh":"前半的谈话环节结束后，\n紧接着就该进入后半环节了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
