{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5a6398c675014e906b5e284bd746eb316d8f5858091f48dd721d48640098f20d","ja":"ワアァァァァァァッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1ea12cce4788478b3fb6a0f03efc583e480d5c0e5b4282e3945ca5ff77609da5","ja":"まずは、百瀬さんと最上さんの\nデュエット曲からですね……おや？","zh":"首先是百濑小姐和最上小姐的\n双人合唱曲呢……哎呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"404913a8cd052f4f173278fa0e69e6f030d82be2a7b07caa960a933512bd2651","ja":"スタッフさん、どうかしましたか？","zh":"工作人员，怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ed9c1218f6e5e532a9bda3653c9c4ee2152244a869853c7233472ed5ce6ae5d9","ja":"「すみません！　業者のトラブルでプレゼントが、\n一部印刷されずに、納品されていたんです！」","zh":"“对不起！因为供应商那边出了问题，\n送过来的礼品中有一部分没有印上图案！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"25ba10bc9a3f5dcd3a618571a350748d6b7feff4fbdd394b94f306d8a8c5a3e5","ja":"もしかして、エンディングでファンの人達に渡す、\nロコたちのメッセージカードのことですか！？","zh":"难道说，是指在谢幕时送给粉丝们的、\nROCO她们的留言卡吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"20eb68a216437f7996d1002eeb983db5dcf66d975bedbab6499a0394dd0f4aa1","ja":"他のプレゼントを探すとか……って、難しいですよね。\nもうイベントも後半戦に入ってますし。","zh":"去找其他的礼物……不过，这也很难吧。\n毕竟活动都已经进入后半段了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"8599daffc3a71fc855427005a12b204df41c50ea94f692467c63eed3115f77f6","ja":"足りないのは何枚ですか？","zh":"还缺少几张？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"09efa752d07ec887b08e7b313994c31a395181dd94126148a3db56c8c306a164","ja":"「たしか、200枚くらいだったかと……」","zh":"「我记得大概是200张左右……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"491bf465f08599ba52b0fa4b458f6948f39085efb9a92a701260406cdf754be1","ja":"それなら、イベントの合間に手分けして書きましょ！\nひとりあたり40枚なら、急げばなんとかなるわ！","zh":"那样的话，就在活动的间隙分头写吧！\n每人40张的话，抓紧一点总能搞定的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"031c2f1a9692058764022fce6734161f5f22134d77f14359e0a538fd9bc0ba56","ja":"そっか、手書きならライブ中でもできますよね！\n自分の出番じゃない時間を利用すれば……。","zh":"对哦，手写的话在演出期间也能写呢！\n只要利用自己不用登台的时间……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1541.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"c7254ebfa2a0fb31ed04ba4c61e380a1cf8eaf7e1f204c15e266a5a868fb3489","ja":"みなさんのために、頑張りましょう！","zh":"为了大家，一起加油吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
